sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Researcher
    participant GO as Go Edge API
    participant API as Python Research API
    participant ST as Store
    participant GEN as discovery_propose()
    participant LLM as DiscoveryLLMHTTPAdapter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant W as BacktestWorker
    participant ENG as DeterministicEngine
    participant EV as EventWorker
    participant EVAL as DeterministicEvaluator

    U->>GO: POST /search-runs {generator_id: discovery}
    GO->>API: signed internal create command
    API->>ST: create_search_run(request, correlation_id)
    ST->>DB: quota/dataset checks + discovery_split()
    ST->>DB: INSERT search_runs(discovery_state with frozen split)
    ST->>GEN: propose(space, seed, archive, research)
    GEN->>LLM: optional typed proposal
    LLM-->>GEN: candidate_definition + provenance
    GEN-->>ST: CandidateEnvelope or provider failure
    ST->>DB: INSERT search_candidate + reservation(reserved_jobs=4)
    ST->>DB: INSERT train experiment + backtest job
    ST-->>API: SearchRunOut(status=running)
    API-->>GO: 202 + run_id
    GO-->>U: 202 + run_id

    loop one active discovery candidate
        W->>DB: claim queued job with lease token
        W->>ENG: run(train snapshot, candles, bbo, sentiment)
        ENG-->>W: Result or deterministic failure
        W->>DB: persist facts + BacktestCompleted outbox atomically
        EV->>DB: claim BacktestCompleted
        EV->>EVAL: evaluate(run facts, policy)
        EVAL-->>EV: evaluation
        EV->>DB: persist evaluation + consume event
        EV->>ST: advance_discovery_for_experiment(experiment_id)
        alt train cheap gate fails
            ST->>DB: archive cheap rejection and release reservation
        else train gate passes
            ST->>DB: INSERT three validation experiments/jobs
            loop each validation completion
                W->>ENG: run(validation snapshot)
                ENG-->>W: Result
                W->>DB: persist facts + BacktestCompleted outbox
                EV->>EVAL: evaluate(validation facts)
                EVAL-->>EV: evaluation
                EV->>ST: advance_discovery_for_experiment()
            end
            ST->>DB: discovery_assessment(train, V1, V2, V3)
            alt positive survivor score
                ST->>DB: archive accepted candidate + update run counters
            else validation/gap/correlation rejection
                ST->>DB: archive rejected candidate
            end
        end
        ST->>GEN: next proposal uses archive and parent selection
    end

    opt normal stop with accepted survivor
        ST->>DB: INSERT one sealed test experiment/job
        W->>ENG: run(test snapshot)
        ENG-->>W: final Result
        W->>DB: persist final facts + outbox
        EV->>EVAL: evaluate final test separately
        EV->>DB: persist final evaluation, no archive or score update
        ST->>DB: mark search_runs completed(final_test_completed)
    end

    Note over ST,DB: Current implementation: Store methods own sequencing.<br/>Reservation records four planned jobs and train is queued first.<br/>Target-only risk_policy and DiscoveryController are not shown as runtime fields.
    Note over GEN,DB: Test data remains sealed and unavailable to proposal, parents or assessment.
